1.2.0 (2026-09-17)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/111
- Added APPINFO-backed MISC artwork using PIPCOIDLEFRAMEWORKS.IMG.
- Replaced the nested Pipquarium provider path with a dedicated low-memory PIPQRUN handoff that runs the separately installed Pipquarium APP.JS.
- Added readable source plus compact installed runtime files for the wake, idle, service, provider, and built-in renderer paths.
- Replaced the eval-loaded bomb image source with BOMB.BIN and reduced co-resident JavaScript state before provider startup.
- Removed whole-module ram directives and retained cleanup/defrag behavior for lower memory pressure.
- Removed runtime diagnostic file writes from the installed runtime.

1.1.0 (2026-09-13)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/104
- Public release with a two-minute idle watcher, built-in PIP-BOY 3000 screensaver, Mesmetron/Pipquarium providers, previews, reset-safe configuration, and low-memory deferred loading.

